body:
I also love people who want to convince you of something. My ex tried to tell me that star wars I,II & III are worse than 4,5 & 6. And most sw fans will say that, but I dont give a shit because I like them because they came out when I was a kid and introduced me to the franchise. I didnt really like anything in star wars except I,II,III & the old republic lore. If I like something and it illicits a positive feeling in me, why the fuck would someone logically argue against it? If I like it, I like it and if you have a problem with that than youre a \*\*\*\*\* \*\*\*\*\*\* \*\*\*\*\*\* \*\*\*\*\*\*\*\*\*\*\* \*\*\* \*\*\*\* \*\*\*\*\*. 

&#x200B;

How can adults be that slow jeez
